{"id":"607852","name":"芹菜肉丝炒面","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/607852/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芹菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半个"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"薄细面条","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"一点点"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"湿面条适量，倒入小半勺花生油。","img":"images/607852/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/607852/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"水开上屉蒸8分钟。","img":"images/607852/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"瘦肉丝适量。","img":"images/607852/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，白胡椒粉，淀粉。","img":"images/607852/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"抓匀稍腌。","img":"images/607852/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"洋葱切粗丝，小米椒切斜段，芹菜切段。","img":"images/607852/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅里宽油烧热，肉丝放入。","img":"images/607852/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用筷子划散，炒至变色盛出。","img":"images/607852/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅里底油烧热，花椒，葱姜蒜，辣椒炒出香味儿。","img":"images/607852/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"芹菜倒入，翻炒几下。","img":"images/607852/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"肉丝倒入，翻炒两下。","img":"images/607852/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入适量开水，适量盐，生抽，老抽，鸡精调味儿。","img":"images/607852/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"烧开。","img":"images/607852/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"这边面条刚好蒸好。","img":"images/607852/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"直接把面条捞入汤汁里。","img":"images/607852/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"让汁水均匀包裹住面条，不停翻炒，让面条吸收了汤汁，沿锅边淋入一圈熟的食用油。","img":"images/607852/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"洋葱，小米椒放入。","img":"images/607852/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"炒至面条微微焦黄。","img":"images/607852/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"关火，盛出。","img":"images/607852/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/607852/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/607852/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}